                "text": "Today, I sent a letter to @DHSgov Secretary Kristi Noem asking that her agency halt attempts by environmental groups to change how the National Flood Insurance Program (NFIP) is implemented in Oregon. \n\nThese changes would undermine the program\u2019s core purpose and impose unnecessary regulatory burdens on our communities. Oregon\u2019s flood insurance should remain focused on protecting homeowners.",
