                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "This morning, I joined KTVZ to discuss the serious challenges facing Oregon and our nation. In Congress, I will continue to push for fiscal responsibility, the preservation of essential programs such as Social Security, Medicare, and Medicaid, and the protection of Oregon\u2019s natural resources, especially as wildfires continue to threaten our forests.\nhttps://t.co/H01r9kl4A7",
