                "quoted_status_profile_username": "HouseCommerce",
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As we work through this markup, my Democrat colleagues have engaged in speculation and out-right misrepresentation of the context and content of the bill. \n\nLet me be clear: Medicare and Medicaid are essential programs and they will be protected!",
