                "retweet_count": 20,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "40% of my constituency depend on Medicaid. I know how essential and necessary Medicaid is. However, if we are to protect Medicaid so that it can continue to help people who are most vulnerable, we must prevent ineligible and illegal persons from wrongful participation.\n\nMedicaid deserves protection, not exploitation.",
