                "text": "Earlier today, I spoke with the Medford Chamber, joined by Commissioner Sparacino, about my work with the White House, the importance of Medicaid, key transportation and infrastructure projects in Southern Oregon, and the ongoing efforts in Congress to keep the government open and working for the American people.",
